WEBVTT

00:08.570 --> 00:15.770
Omoi wo ima hanadete hatenai asu ni kazasu yo

00:08.570 --> 00:15.770
I now play my feelings,
out to the endless tomorrow!

00:15.810 --> 00:22.520
Setsunai hodo mune utsu kagirinai kibou

00:15.810 --> 00:22.520
This unbounded hope that beats in my breast
to the point of melancholy

00:23.320 --> 00:31.120
Hakanasa wo masu hibi wo
irodoru wa kisetsu no kaze

00:23.320 --> 00:31.120
The days pass by, becoming more fleeting,
colored by the season's wind

00:31.160 --> 00:35.830
Kioku no kakera ga sawagidashita yo

00:31.160 --> 00:35.830
The fragments of memory started running wild

00:36.430 --> 00:44.830
Arinomama wo mitomete
haruka tsumuida hikari ga

00:36.430 --> 00:44.830
One more time, I want to hold the
spindle of far off light close to my breast,

00:44.880 --> 00:52.510
Kieru mae ni mou ichido
kono mune ni dakishimete

00:44.880 --> 00:52.510
Before it disappears, before
I accept the way things are now

00:54.590 --> 01:01.790
Omoi wo ima hanadete hatenai asu ni kazasu yo

00:54.590 --> 01:01.790
I now play my feelings,
out to the endless tomorrow!

01:01.790 --> 01:08.930
Mirai wo egaku ao ni kono te wo nobashite

01:01.790 --> 01:08.930
Hold out this hand to the blue-painted future

01:09.100 --> 01:16.230
Kasokushiteku sekai yo douka
yasashii mama de ite

01:09.100 --> 01:16.230
The world accelerates, please let it stay this kind

01:16.340 --> 01:23.840
Setsunai hodo mune utsu afuredasu negai

01:16.340 --> 01:23.840
This overflowing wish that beats in my breast
to the point of melancholy

01:32.920 --> 01:36.020
Ichika, I want to tell you the truth.

01:36.020 --> 01:36.990
I...

01:41.130 --> 01:42.860
Sei?

01:47.500 --> 01:49.040
Where am I?

01:49.040 --> 01:50.510
You can't do that.

01:50.510 --> 01:53.030
That's a violation of the rules, Sei.

01:57.310 --> 01:58.950
Sei?

01:58.950 --> 01:59.740
Sei?

02:01.580 --> 02:02.740
Could it be...

02:09.020 --> 02:11.430
Ichika... Ichika?

02:14.330 --> 02:18.820
You're doing the same thing
you did to me six years ago!

02:20.370 --> 02:24.400
You plan to do it to her, to Ichika, right?

02:26.410 --> 02:32.040
She has already invited the power
of nine Djinn into her body...

02:32.410 --> 02:36.910
And during the time, she has taken the
seven ordeals, accepted the seven vices.

02:39.590 --> 02:41.320
It's already come this far?

02:41.790 --> 02:44.820
There is no turning back.

02:48.360 --> 02:55.930
All that is left is to see what
her final decision is going to be.

03:02.340 --> 03:03.710
My body...

03:10.290 --> 03:12.080
It'd be best not to move.

03:12.420 --> 03:15.720
If you shatter, even I could not repair you.

03:20.900 --> 03:22.420
This is his penalty.

03:24.670 --> 03:27.660
He will sleep for a little while.

03:29.870 --> 03:35.070
I will awaken him after that girl
shows me her final decision.

03:35.740 --> 03:37.010
Help me.

03:42.320 --> 03:46.820
Reunion Beyond the Grave

03:52.490 --> 03:56.090
What's the matter? You should at least
be able to eat that much.

03:56.630 --> 03:58.770
I'm not hungry.

03:58.770 --> 04:00.770
Your cheeks are hollow...

04:00.770 --> 04:04.030
That's quite enough dieting. Now, eat.

04:04.970 --> 04:06.000
Ichika...

04:10.480 --> 04:12.540
What did you say, Ichika dear?

04:12.850 --> 04:14.410
I'm not hungry!

04:22.420 --> 04:25.920
Ichika is worried about a lot of things.

04:27.860 --> 04:28.830
I see.

04:29.400 --> 04:32.460
Manatsu, will you help her?

04:34.100 --> 04:35.470
Please...

04:35.970 --> 04:36.730
I will.

04:42.510 --> 04:45.550
Please, let this all be over...

04:45.550 --> 04:46.510
Everything...

04:47.720 --> 04:48.770
Sei...

04:49.650 --> 04:52.850
It was getting in the way
and I needed to get rid of it.

04:55.490 --> 04:58.290
Ichika, where are you going? Ichika?

04:58.290 --> 04:59.590
A walk.

04:59.590 --> 05:02.390
Come on, wait up! Ichika!

05:11.010 --> 05:13.030
Ichika! Ichika!

05:13.940 --> 05:15.500
She went over there?

05:46.840 --> 05:49.970
Sei, I'm sorry.

06:10.530 --> 06:13.330
I can't even throw it away.

06:16.910 --> 06:21.100
Yes. You can no longer escape.

06:47.770 --> 06:49.760
I can't...

06:50.370 --> 06:51.510
I'm scared...

06:51.510 --> 06:52.500
Ichika!

06:54.910 --> 06:55.840
Ichika!

07:07.220 --> 07:09.020
Ichi... ka...

07:09.020 --> 07:10.320
Manatsu...

07:16.400 --> 07:17.390
Ichika!

07:17.730 --> 07:20.800
Let go! You're going to fall, too!

07:20.800 --> 07:24.070
Idiot! I could never do that!

07:30.550 --> 07:31.640
Ichika...

07:35.180 --> 07:38.810
Hurry, Manatsu...

07:56.470 --> 07:57.460
You can't...

07:58.410 --> 08:01.270
I don't want you to die, Ichika.

08:02.480 --> 08:04.750
Manatsu...

08:04.750 --> 08:07.680
I'm the one that should die!

08:07.680 --> 08:11.120
I'm the one who you shouldn't shed a tear for!

08:11.990 --> 08:13.280
Manatsu...

08:13.990 --> 08:15.750
I'm not human.

08:16.120 --> 08:20.430
Even if I wanted to be one,
I'd always be something different.

08:20.930 --> 08:23.330
I'm the one who should...

08:30.770 --> 08:32.540
Don't kill yourself.

08:33.010 --> 08:35.100
Don't throw away your life.

08:36.410 --> 08:37.340
Ichika...

08:42.920 --> 08:44.280
I'm sorry!

08:45.090 --> 08:47.250
I'm so sorry, Manatsu!

08:48.020 --> 08:49.580
I'm sorry!

09:00.540 --> 09:04.510
Three more, and then it's all over.

09:04.510 --> 09:06.240
I will make it all come to an end.

09:07.810 --> 09:12.080
Thank you, Ichika. You've gotten pretty strong.

09:12.080 --> 09:14.180
That's not true.

09:14.180 --> 09:17.950
But, if it were...

09:17.950 --> 09:19.040
Yeah?

09:21.720 --> 09:22.950
That's a secret.

09:36.270 --> 09:37.470
Are you okay?

09:40.180 --> 09:41.230
Yes...

09:41.910 --> 09:45.480
No matter what I ate, it was bitter, like sand.

09:45.480 --> 09:49.480
But I had decided to no longer run away,

09:49.480 --> 09:54.010
to gird my heart against
the something yet unseen.

10:00.230 --> 10:01.800
Are you buckled up?

10:01.800 --> 10:02.890
Yup!

10:04.400 --> 10:06.370
It seems like she's calmed down.

10:06.970 --> 10:09.030
Okay, let's go.

10:21.120 --> 10:22.550
Visiting a grave?

10:23.350 --> 10:26.080
Lighting a fire for the dead,
a little late after Bon, though.

10:35.700 --> 10:43.670
The number you wish to call is either
out of the service area or turned off

10:50.150 --> 10:51.180


10:51.180 --> 10:55.780
It seems I have bad timing.

10:58.120 --> 11:00.050
What is the matter, Rui?

11:00.760 --> 11:03.390
Still worried about your friend
that is moving away?

11:03.390 --> 11:04.190
Yeah.

11:05.430 --> 11:06.220
Do not worry.

11:07.030 --> 11:08.860
No matter how far apart you may be,

11:08.860 --> 11:12.800
if you truly wish to meet again,
one day you surely will.

11:13.170 --> 11:15.770
Really, Sister?

11:15.770 --> 11:19.710
Yes. As long as you are alive, without doubt.

11:34.390 --> 11:37.830
Ichika has really grown.

11:37.830 --> 11:39.920
She is already 14.

11:40.530 --> 11:45.030
Which means it's already been
15 or 16 years since then.

11:45.730 --> 11:48.400
Yes. That was when I saw the dream...

11:53.440 --> 11:55.170
How are you doing?

11:58.950 --> 12:03.710
I came to pray to Buddha for children
of my daughter and her husband.

12:06.750 --> 12:09.380
I see... So even the doctors...

12:09.860 --> 12:14.090
They told me I shouldn't be
in such a hurry, but...

12:14.100 --> 12:17.030
Children are a blessing from Heaven.

12:17.030 --> 12:18.530
One shouldn't rush...

12:18.530 --> 12:20.000
But...

12:20.000 --> 12:21.240
But?

12:21.240 --> 12:25.610
But the two of them had a dream...

12:25.610 --> 12:26.570
A dream?

12:26.570 --> 12:30.770
Yes. It was a strange dream.

12:31.910 --> 12:36.410
Now that I think back, is that other girl
the one from the dream?

12:38.320 --> 12:39.550
Perhaps.

12:40.560 --> 12:42.420
That's what we believe.

12:42.760 --> 12:44.760
My father's voice...

12:44.760 --> 12:48.630
Or rather, I want to believe in that dream.

12:48.630 --> 12:49.620
A dream?

12:53.570 --> 12:55.070
Where are we?

12:55.070 --> 12:56.200
We're...

13:06.280 --> 13:09.080
If you have a child...

13:09.080 --> 13:10.810
That voice...

13:11.390 --> 13:16.420
When they grow up, and bring a friend
with them to stay for the summer...

13:16.790 --> 13:23.160
Would you be able to treat that other child
with kindness like it were your own?

13:23.430 --> 13:24.590
Darling...

13:26.930 --> 13:30.560
If our child... If our child really asks us to...

13:30.970 --> 13:33.440
Can you promise?

13:36.110 --> 13:37.100
We promise.

13:42.380 --> 13:46.580
Ichika grew up so well, it was almost
like she didn't need us.

13:47.160 --> 13:50.530
Lately she's gotten a bit more mature,

13:50.530 --> 13:53.690
and she doesn't tell us even if
she's worried about something.

13:54.100 --> 13:55.590
Mother...

13:56.030 --> 14:00.530
It's kind of lonely, but I'm happy
she's growing up.

14:01.200 --> 14:02.830
We're such foolish doters.

14:05.040 --> 14:06.300
Father...

14:09.580 --> 14:12.840
But, that dream...

14:14.520 --> 14:17.780
It was then I came to realize.

14:18.490 --> 14:21.390
That all the things that happened this summer

14:21.390 --> 14:26.830
were planned out and decided by someone
before I was even born.

14:28.560 --> 14:33.060
Dream... I'm sure I've had a dream, too.

14:33.370 --> 14:36.970
The same dream, over and over again...

14:36.970 --> 14:38.410
That dream...

14:46.550 --> 14:48.210
I'm sorry Ichika...

14:48.580 --> 14:52.690
I really am sorry... Farewell...

14:52.690 --> 14:53.890
And...

14:53.890 --> 14:57.160
What do you mean? Who are you?

14:57.160 --> 14:58.630
What in the world do you...

14:58.630 --> 15:01.760
I am you, and you are me...

15:01.760 --> 15:03.930
But I am going...

15:06.270 --> 15:07.960
...to kill you.

15:21.880 --> 15:24.280
Ichika, there you are!

15:24.590 --> 15:27.220
You didn't come back so I got worried.

15:27.220 --> 15:27.920
Manatsu...

15:27.920 --> 15:29.290
I'm not human!

15:31.060 --> 15:32.250
Ichika?

15:32.830 --> 15:35.030
It's nothing.

15:35.030 --> 15:36.700
Your face is turning blue.

15:36.700 --> 15:38.500
That's just the shade.

15:38.500 --> 15:39.600
W-wait!

15:39.600 --> 15:40.900
I won't lose.

15:41.770 --> 15:45.360
I promised I wouldn't run away.

15:45.640 --> 15:47.840
That I'd believe in Manatsu.

15:54.720 --> 15:55.980
Ichika?

15:56.320 --> 15:57.510
Manatsu...

15:58.990 --> 16:02.010
You're on my side, right Manatsu?

16:03.990 --> 16:07.830
I don't want to lie to Ichika any longer.

16:07.830 --> 16:12.160
Manatsu worried for me so much
yesterday at the ocean.

16:13.070 --> 16:17.540
Please, let me believe in Manatsu...

16:17.540 --> 16:20.940
I want to help you! I want to be
on your side, Ichika!

16:20.940 --> 16:24.380
But, my role is only to guide you on the path...

16:24.380 --> 16:26.710
Allying with you is a violation of the rules.

16:27.350 --> 16:29.080
Manatsu...

16:29.550 --> 16:33.820
If I break the rules, I will never
be able to see Ichika again.

16:34.120 --> 16:38.620
And there are still three Djinn left,
so to save Ichika...

16:39.360 --> 16:40.930
Manatsu!

16:40.930 --> 16:43.600
I'm sorry, I can't answer.

16:43.600 --> 16:44.100
But...

16:44.100 --> 16:44.430
You lie.

16:48.440 --> 16:49.200
Ichika!

16:57.950 --> 16:59.280
Ichika!

17:03.120 --> 17:05.180
The Djinn, Tenebra...

17:05.520 --> 17:07.650
The messenger from the underworld...

17:25.740 --> 17:29.200
Ichika... Is it really too late?

17:36.150 --> 17:37.240
Ichika!

17:41.360 --> 17:42.580
These hands?

17:46.060 --> 17:47.430
Grandma?

17:49.460 --> 17:50.690
Shiro?

17:59.370 --> 18:00.530
Ichika...

18:20.600 --> 18:21.190
Hi...

18:37.910 --> 18:40.080
Are you okay, Ichika?

18:40.080 --> 18:41.480
But, how?

18:41.480 --> 18:46.040
I totally thought you were going to go wild
with the Djinn's power again...

18:47.590 --> 18:52.090
It's easy for anyone to run from
the reality before their eyes and lie...

18:52.760 --> 18:57.260
But ever since we pinky swore back then,

18:59.570 --> 19:03.770
even if you didn't answer or said little lies...

19:04.770 --> 19:06.710
I'm not human!

19:07.270 --> 19:11.750
You never lied to me about
anything important, did you?

19:11.750 --> 19:12.770
Ichika...

19:13.280 --> 19:17.270
And yet I tried to run away... I lied to myself...

19:18.190 --> 19:25.620
It's because I'm that pitiful that
I decided to stand up and face it.

19:25.930 --> 19:28.590
Ichika, you have gotten strong.

19:29.230 --> 19:31.170
You really have...

19:31.170 --> 19:33.770
Ichika dear, Manatsu!

19:33.770 --> 19:35.070
It's time to go home!

19:35.840 --> 19:36.890
Let's go!

19:37.240 --> 19:39.500
Right, let's go home!

19:44.850 --> 19:48.340
Sei isn't coming today either...

19:56.590 --> 19:56.620


19:57.490 --> 20:03.930
No one is home,
Please leave a message after the beep.

20:03.930 --> 20:07.600
Sei's cellphone, too...

20:09.470 --> 20:13.970
This is Ichika. It seems your tutoring
schedule has changed, so...

20:14.210 --> 20:17.770
Are you feeling okay, Sei?

20:18.280 --> 20:21.250
Please call back whenever it is convenient.

20:24.320 --> 20:27.020
Yes? Oh, Ichika!

20:27.660 --> 20:30.850
Sorry about this, Sei didn't come, did he?

20:31.530 --> 20:35.300
He went off to a college seminar
all of a sudden...

20:35.300 --> 20:38.030
Oh, it's okay then.

20:38.030 --> 20:41.540
I thought something
might have happened... So...

20:41.540 --> 20:44.970
Sorry! I have something I
really need to deal with right now.

20:44.970 --> 20:46.170
Sorry about this.

20:48.180 --> 20:53.550
I said it before, but you and Kai
really are similar.

20:55.020 --> 20:57.010
I guess...

20:59.020 --> 21:00.720
It won't be long.

21:00.720 --> 21:04.890
I wonder if she will have
the same result as that child.

21:04.890 --> 21:08.290
Every human is different.

21:10.230 --> 21:11.030
Isn't it true?

21:14.070 --> 21:15.130
Manatsu?

21:16.670 --> 21:19.870
Do you love me, Manatsu?

21:22.710 --> 21:25.010
I hate it when you tease me, Ichika!

21:25.010 --> 21:26.380
I'm sorry.

21:26.710 --> 21:30.210
It's okay... I'm sorry too.

21:31.520 --> 21:38.980
That day was the first time I really felt
like I saw Manatsu's true self.

21:40.260 --> 21:47.290
But I also knew there was only a brief time left
until the day we part.

21:47.700 --> 21:50.670


21:51.210 --> 22:00.770
Ano hi deawanakereba ima mo
waraeteta no ka na?

21:51.210 --> 22:00.770
If we hadn't met that day,
would I have still been able to laugh now?

22:02.150 --> 22:13.650
Ano hi nakushita egao itsuka tokeru namida

22:02.150 --> 22:13.650
The smile I lost that day,
the tears that one day melt away...

22:19.170 --> 22:28.940
Hora kotoshi mo ame furu gogo
hakanai utakata no iro

22:19.170 --> 22:28.940
See, this year the afternoon rain falls again
in the color of fleeting bubbles

22:30.010 --> 22:38.850
Sora mo yasashiku mienai wa
datte hitori da mono

22:30.010 --> 22:38.850
The sky doesn't look kind to me, after all,
I'm alone

22:40.490 --> 22:45.490
Itazura na sadame ni kotoba mo denai wa

22:40.490 --> 22:45.490
I have no more words for the tricks of fate

22:45.890 --> 22:53.290
Wakariaeta futari ni mou modorenai no?

22:45.890 --> 22:53.290
Can we never return to two
who understood each other?

22:53.870 --> 23:03.470
Ano hi deawanakereba ima mo
waraeteta no ka na?

22:53.870 --> 23:03.470
If we hadn't met that day,
would I have still been able to laugh now?

23:04.850 --> 23:16.550
Ano hi nakushita egao itsuka tokeru namida

23:04.850 --> 23:16.550
The smile I lost that day,
the tears that one day melt away...

23:20.660 --> 23:20.690


23:20.690 --> 23:21.730


23:21.730 --> 23:25.330
Even if you stop believing in your own heart,

23:25.330 --> 23:26.700
as long as there is someone,

23:26.700 --> 23:29.270
even a single person, who believes in you...

23:29.270 --> 23:35.000
On that day I came to realize
that's all you need for power to flow forth.

23:35.710 --> 23:40.410
On the next Uta~Kata:
The Surge of Separation
